CARLUCCI: We also need to consider some other actions. We need to: 
                        1.

start consultations immediately with Congress and Allies;
                        2.

continue our legal research, which could take an additional 3
                            months;

CARLUCCI: Cap (Weinberger), could DoD
                    submit to the President a report on how, specifically, the SDI program would be restructured if authorized;
                    including what changes to testing and why?
